==Enemy==
Doge is the first enemy and the main and only opponent faced in [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea/Nagasaki]]. In almost all stages he appears in, he is used as a meatshield for stronger enemies of all sorts. Do not fear this enemy because he can be defeated with anything you use for more significant enemies.

==Strategy==
With his low stats, Doge can be easily killed by almost anything, including even low-level [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]. Although he can be ignored most of the time, be aware of his extreme buffs in [[Way of the Ninja (Insane)]] and [[The Noble Tribe]]. In later encounters, the use of [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attack Cats]] like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] is recommended to clear waves of Doges, in lieu of [[:Category:Single Attack Cats|Single Attack Cats]] or others who may miss because of a Doge getting in the way, although this is far from necessary.

